OL,3,AHelen Jenner announced by Nigel Farage
OL,4,Aas new leader of Reform in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Farage has announced Helen Jenner
OL,7,Fas the new leader of Reform in Wales,
OL,8,Freplacing Dan Thomas after his arrest
OL,9,Fon suspicion of assault and controlling
OL,10,For coercive behaviour.
OL,12,FSpeaking on the steps of the Senedd in
OL,13,FCardiff on Monday, Farage said: "I've
OL,14,Fknown Helen for many, many years. She
OL,15,Fis a determined campaigner."
OL,17,FFarage said he was sorry for former
OL,18,Fleader Thomas's "personal
OL,19,Fdifficulties", but said it had been
OL,20,Funtenable for him to continue.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
